💎 Diamond Pi Coin

Mainnet-ready Digital Asset & Wallet Platform

Diamond Pi Coin is a modern digital asset platform designed for wallet management, asset tracking, transaction processing, and blockchain-ready infrastructure.

The project supports PI, BTC, ETH, and USDT through a responsive dashboard, Flask REST API, and PostgreSQL database architecture.

«🚀 Project Status: Mainnet-ready Architecture
⚠️ Blockchain Status: This repository does not by itself represent a live public blockchain mainnet.»

