⚙️ Local Development

1. Clone Repository

git clone https://github.com/Coinbeas/diamond-pi-coin.git
cd diamond-pi-coin

2. Create Virtual Environment

python -m venv .venv

3. Activate Environment

Linux/macOS:

source .venv/bin/activate

Windows:

.venv\Scripts\activate

4. Install Dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

5. Configure Environment

Create ".env":

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/diamond_pi_coin
SECRET_KEY=change-this-secret

6. Initialize Database

psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f database/schema.sql

7. Start Flask

python app.py

Open:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

