⚠️ Important Status Notice

Diamond Pi Coin is currently an application and blockchain-ready architecture project.

The repository's dashboard, database, API, and sample asset values do not independently establish:

- a live public blockchain;
- a functioning decentralized consensus network;
- independently verified PI market value;
- real on-chain balances;
- real blockchain transaction settlement.

A live mainnet requires independently operating network infrastructure, verifiable chain data, transaction signing, consensus, node software, secure key management, and production security controls.

